鏡よ 教えて
Mirror, mirror, tell me...

752
00:54:33,880 --> 00:54:36,080
私の証は
Where can I find...

753
00:54:36,080 --> 00:54:39,280
どこにあるのだろう
...the proof of who I am?

754
00:54:39,280 --> 00:54:42,080
分からない 分からないよ
I don't know, I just don't know...

755
00:54:42,080 --> 00:54:44,280
周りと比べたってさ
Even if I compare myself to others,

756
00:54:44,280 --> 00:54:47,480
虚しくなるだけ
it only leaves me feeling empty.

757
00:54:47,480 --> 00:54:52,580
あぁ ノイズが 海鳴りのように ナミダを奪う
Ah, the noise steals away my tears like the roaring of the sea.

758
00:54:52,580 --> 00:54:55,280
切り取った風景を
Let's turn these captured scenery...

759
00:54:55,280 --> 00:54:57,480
道しるべにしよう
...into our guiding light.

760
00:54:57,480 --> 00:55:00,080
そうだ 傷ついた感情も
Yes, even the hurt feelings...

